**File:** `/home/arrafi/reactbits-mcp-server/src/services/ReactBitsScraper.ts`, lines 143-145

```typescript
private extractDependencies(code: string): string[] {
  const dependencies: string[] = [];
  const imports = this.extractImports(code);  // <-- re-runs the full regex pass
