### ISSUE 10 [LOW -- Repeated `.toLowerCase()` Calls in Search]: Same string lowercased multiple times per comparison

**File:** `/home/arrafi/reactbits-mcp-server/src/services/ReactBitsService.ts`, lines 229-234

```typescript
